"d":"2019-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Rabinowitz","x":"They've got their DNA extraction and their oncology pipeline and a whole series of technologies that synergize beautifully with woman's health and they've got this packaging of sample to in-flight approach where they really streamline those collapse (ph).","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/12/natera-inc-ntra-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2019 Q1","e":"ntra","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"We think that's going to be super valuable for Medicare from a cost-saving standpoint.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/natera-ntra-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2019 Q1","e":"ntra","d":"2019-05-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Adam Wieschhaus","x":"You reiterated guidance despite having the transplant draft LCD coming out seemingly sooner than expected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/10/natera-ntra-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2019 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2019-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Brophy","x":"Stock-based comp charges related to the share price increase and litigation expenses that we don't think are permanent ongoing expenses contributed significantly to the increase, but we did see the expecting operating expenses ramp up consistent with our guide as we prepare to launch transplant…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/natera-ntra-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2019 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2019-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Solomon Moshkevich","x":"We believe this can lead to better outcomes and significant cost savings for the healthcare system.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/natera-ntra-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2019 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2019-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Tycho Peterson","x":"And then just any comments you can make on the government push around kidney transplants, the cost reduction initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/natera-ntra-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2020 Q1","e":"ntra","d":"2020-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Having said all that, we withdrew our guide for the year, specifically because the cadence of the recovery is hard to forecast.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/natera-ntra-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"NTRA 2021 Q3","e":"ntra","d":"2021-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"…we really don't have to do any additional workflow and so although I think we could go try to take price, we made the decision to just pass this through as a benefit to patients and to physicians without increasing the price in any way, but it's an exceptionally streamlined workflow where…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/natera-inc-ntra-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2025-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Finally, we're gonna spend some time later on the call in the investments we're making in artificial intelligence.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/natera-ntra-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2025-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Finally, we're investing in AI and AI-enabled technology which we will outline on the call today, which we think could revolutionize care and make a big impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/natera-ntra-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2025-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"You know, that's really more cost reduction and user experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/07/natera-ntra-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q3","e":"ntra","d":"2025-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Doug talked about the biomarker bills as, you know, Mike gave the $50 kind of price increase over the course of the year through '26 as like a decent starting point.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/09/natera-ntra-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q3","e":"ntra","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Organ Health was also very strong with both greenfield and competitive wins, and we will continue to keep our foot on the gas as we head several clinical trials ongoing that further demonstrate how much utility and cost savings these tests are delivering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/09/natera-ntra-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q3","e":"ntra","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Brophy","x":"There is something to the idea that, hey, like, when you have, like, these big, you know, national plans and they've got to get it set up to cover Signatera in one area but then not the other, and the clinical utility and the cost savings is so obviously there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/09/natera-ntra-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q3","e":"ntra","d":"2025-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Steve Chapman","x":"Finally, on guidance, we are substantially raising our guide for free cash flow generation for the year, where we are now formally expecting to generate roughly $100 million in cash for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/09/natera-ntra-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q4","e":"ntra","d":"2026-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Solomon Moshkevich","x":"Our recently submitted technical assessment is a key step towards broader reimbursement and scaled adoption in CRC, and another driver of MRD growth as we expand access and streamline ordering.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/natera-ntra-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2025 Q4","e":"ntra","d":"2026-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael B. Brophy","x":"After making the investments to get to the right-size commercial channels, particularly in oncology, we are now in a place where we can drive substantial top-line growth while holding SG&A roughly stable in 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/natera-ntra-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2026 Q1","e":"ntra","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Solomon Moshkevich","x":"…two different health economic studies have been presented in the past, one by a Blue Shield plan and one by a large private payer in the UK called Bupa, showing that MRD-guided treatment in stage II and III colorectal cancer can result in meaningful cost savings to the system ranging 21% to 43%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/natera-ntra-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2026 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Noah Kava","x":"I think you mentioned an AI project last year that could drive $200 million in cost savings over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/natera-ntra-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NTRA 2026 Q2","e":"ntra","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Brophy","x":"And we have generated very high returns on these cost reduction projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/natera-ntra-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[36,1,9278,0,0,0,8182,734],[37,1,7308,0,0,0,689